# Clawd Presence Dashboard

A polished terminal-based presence display with custom monogram support.

## Quick Start

Launch the presence dashboard immediately:

    ./scripts/display.py

## Configuration

The dashboard uses clawd_config.json for settings. Modify with:

    # Set agent name
    ./scripts/configure.py --name "YOUR_NAME"

    # Set idle timeout (in seconds)
    ./scripts/configure.py --timeout 420

    # Set monogram letter
    ./scripts/configure.py --monogram Q

    # View current configuration
    ./scripts/configure.py --show

## Available Scripts

- display.py    - Launch the presence dashboard
- configure.py  - Configure agent name, timeout, and monogram
- status.py     - Check current status and configuration

## Default Settings

- Agent Name:   QUARTZ
- Idle Timeout: 420 seconds (7 minutes)
- Monogram:     Q
- Theme:        Dark

## Monograms

Custom monograms can be placed in assets/monograms/ as .txt files.
For example, assets/monograms/Q.txt contains the Q monogram.

## Usage

1. Run ./scripts/configure.py --show to see current settings
2. Adjust settings if needed using configure.py
3. Launch the dashboard with ./scripts/display.py
4. Press Ctrl+C to exit

Clawd Presence - Stay visible, stay connected.


